  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.compressVertices",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:acc032af8a617ddc7686dfd1b83571ef91756bd6c2a5ef8f52e51d07a71fdf7b",
      "text": "压缩并打包几何法线属性值，以节省内存。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.compressVertices",
      "field": "params/geometry/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:73e71711c64fae823007c59d74fde42b80de5ed6bb57fb49c56fdec15b0aa1ae",
      "text": "需要修改的几何体。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.compressVertices",
      "field": "returns/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:0ea21d56fafb8e25012171832b99183437e5eb143e7cd406110c1e97931183f1",
      "text": "修改后的 <code>geometry</code> 参数，其法线已压缩并打包。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.computeNormal",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:f834855518f5c5fc499b625c244d87cfd860c3f3ded75a2122e7e9661bf31fcf",
      "text": "为包含 <code>TRIANGLES</code> 的几何体计算逐顶点法线，方法是对与该顶点相接的全部三角形法线求平均。结果作为新的 <code>normal</code> 属性加入几何体。假定三角形采用逆时针绕序。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.computeNormal",
      "field": "exceptions/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:2927de52684e8fa425e603b65d8d6e020583fab755ab514d2a2db13ccf4b7650",
      "text": "geometry.indices 的长度必须大于 0 且为 3 的倍数。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.computeNormal",
      "field": "exceptions/1/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:33acdd4999238f83865cb98f6c60d18d203d76eec7d5564a97e9de40a0203933",
      "text": "geometry.primitiveType 必须为 {@link PrimitiveType.TRIANGLES}。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.computeNormal",
      "field": "params/geometry/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:73e71711c64fae823007c59d74fde42b80de5ed6bb57fb49c56fdec15b0aa1ae",
      "text": "需要修改的几何体。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.computeNormal",
      "field": "returns/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:124b7aa0151083fc03a0b61d20b30d0619805d5a9298e12fb98062ba5dda9b62",
      "text": "修改后的 <code>geometry</code> 参数，包含计算得到的 <code>normal</code> 属性。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.computeTangentAndBitangent",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:2efc6fc84462ac8e392723c9a9089786a51a60356431118c96b1adfb0b6f378e",
      "text": "为包含 <code>TRIANGLES</code> 的几何体计算逐顶点切线和副切线，并将结果作为新的 <code>tangent</code> 和 <code>bitangent</code> 属性加入几何体。假定三角形采用逆时针绕序。\n<p>\n基于 Eric Lengyel 的 <a href=\"http://www.terathon.com/code/tangent.html\">Computing Tangent Space Basis Vectors for an Arbitrary Mesh</a>。\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.computeTangentAndBitangent",
      "field": "exceptions/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:2927de52684e8fa425e603b65d8d6e020583fab755ab514d2a2db13ccf4b7650",
      "text": "geometry.indices 的长度必须大于 0 且为 3 的倍数。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.computeTangentAndBitangent",
      "field": "exceptions/1/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:33acdd4999238f83865cb98f6c60d18d203d76eec7d5564a97e9de40a0203933",
      "text": "geometry.primitiveType 必须为 {@link PrimitiveType.TRIANGLES}。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.computeTangentAndBitangent",
      "field": "params/geometry/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:73e71711c64fae823007c59d74fde42b80de5ed6bb57fb49c56fdec15b0aa1ae",
      "text": "需要修改的几何体。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.computeTangentAndBitangent",
      "field": "returns/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:77e32d938f5c3abd3e1dc4afd1d145518a8e01492657593c78f065bb52ea812c",
      "text": "修改后的 <code>geometry</code> 参数，包含计算得到的 <code>tangent</code> 和 <code>bitangent</code> 属性。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.createAttributeLocations",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:b28ca844d1c65f3f523f774227b72d4dc93076eecea1f429a0ac759c7b5278f6",
      "text": "创建将属性名称映射到唯一位置索引的对象，以匹配顶点属性和着色器程序。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.createAttributeLocations",
      "field": "params/geometry/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:6897c5ae52bac78bd9048336efc503388e85f5e8ac880c545885aa31e75a6b47",
      "text": "用于创建映射对象的几何体，本身不会被修改。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.createAttributeLocations",
      "field": "returns/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:18baade6be86bb88e6a8087d19bed7b70fa3d83c2a935686c010f65fcce5503c",
      "text": "属性名称与索引的键值对象。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.createLineSegmentsForVectors",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:057a55e865934249dbe17f6762c81d884f44398536445e42d46a4ff3d3aad6d6",
      "text": "为给定几何体创建新的 {@link Geometry}，使用 <code>LINES</code> 表示指定属性 <code>attributeName</code>。用于显示法线、切线和副切线等向量属性。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.createLineSegmentsForVectors",
      "field": "exceptions/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:6727a2472c9f8e2db392181ead372650d576913a4c3d6ab046cb0b0005490a25",
      "text": "geometry.attributes 必须包含与 attributeName 参数同名的属性。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.createLineSegmentsForVectors",
      "field": "params/attributeName/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:dbcf97c4a4a016d98595663cd64cbfa15906e8a56a51550094231a010e44383f",
      "text": "属性名称。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.createLineSegmentsForVectors",
      "field": "params/geometry/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:c0b1863c5aed38f86cced875ef8f09d0e6ceb3b3d937083896c20cb745e38238",
      "text": "包含该属性的 <code>Geometry</code> 实例。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.createLineSegmentsForVectors",
      "field": "params/length/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:7eabb54926ee62e8880dd3e5a0f4cab85aae556e4bf1b07f483abff06ccbc95a",
      "text": "每条线段的长度，单位为米。可使用负值，使向量指向相反方向。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.createLineSegmentsForVectors",
      "field": "returns/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:502cbae63b5683e9adfe126013c9e4ec3c0302c862b6c5de9f2c7e2717030566",
      "text": "包含向量线段的新 <code>Geometry</code> 实例。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.encodeAttribute",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:fd34692cd84b8499db4cb69f0c10dce98628ad00b33bc6d13cc8b82343115d38",
      "text": "将浮点几何属性值编码为两个独立属性，以提高渲染精度。\n<p>\n常用于生成高精度位置顶点属性。\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.encodeAttribute",
      "field": "exceptions/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:a2d59e4236dc92d440d08d2d561e6ab730d0cacbdbae637c4b181f479a6feaee",
      "text": "geometry 必须包含与 attributeName 参数匹配的属性。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.encodeAttribute",
      "field": "exceptions/1/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:95f8bf10ed23d922b97b445a948c6585e3a1c53b7aef47e8f38afdd7ddcafbe6",
      "text": "属性的 componentDatatype 必须为 ComponentDatatype.DOUBLE。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.encodeAttribute",
      "field": "params/attributeHighName/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:12ed8e816995d2533d6891ed225ecb32b7def935704f91588815e48bdc12ff27",
      "text": "存储编码高位部分的属性名称。"
    },
    {
