      "sourceHash": "sha256:86e857d07d30fd94997d3f61cf136c7fe3b0edec99593ed3eec68e8349bb4d16",
      "text": "存储编码低位部分的属性名称。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.encodeAttribute",
      "field": "params/attributeName/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:dbcf97c4a4a016d98595663cd64cbfa15906e8a56a51550094231a010e44383f",
      "text": "属性名称。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.encodeAttribute",
      "field": "params/geometry/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:73e71711c64fae823007c59d74fde42b80de5ed6bb57fb49c56fdec15b0aa1ae",
      "text": "需要修改的几何体。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.encodeAttribute",
      "field": "returns/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:6bc3ab25f5be5fcc87bd18262bfa6d353d4c04cf2471dea1590b050b5e817e88",
      "text": "修改后的 <code>geometry</code> 参数，包含编码后的属性。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.fitToUnsignedShortIndices",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:583a656bb6e0bec25335ca0c515df65f65c2f7aa88f7ef7599698a4d2bcd588d",
      "text": "必要时将一个几何体拆分为多个几何体，确保 <code>indices</code> 中的索引可用无符号短整数表示，以满足不支持无符号整数索引时的 WebGL 要求。\n<p>\n几何体没有 <code>indices</code> 时，此函数不产生影响。\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.fitToUnsignedShortIndices",
      "field": "exceptions/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:0979a327f5678a55afae5acc526859b006a7e5e7c3f4e8622b4fc19178ad0b9b",
      "text": "geometry.primitiveType 必须为 PrimitiveType.TRIANGLES、PrimitiveType.LINES 或 PrimitiveType.POINTS。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.fitToUnsignedShortIndices",
      "field": "exceptions/1/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:fb2907ddf2dc4e5b1aa1728faaeba4446f806c6ee31e549ddab43b776e1d1935",
      "text": "各几何属性的数据列表必须对应相同的顶点数量。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.fitToUnsignedShortIndices",
      "field": "params/geometry/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:b6d271e8d8e8e5a708c1704e5bc2b63436b29b6d964aff11b6489e244a469888",
      "text": "需要拆分为多个几何体的几何体。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.fitToUnsignedShortIndices",
      "field": "returns/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:0fc2b9c8d8a847675c726f38f36c6450f0306b815489aaea621d28eeb4f1205a",
      "text": "几何体数组，其中每个几何体的索引都可用无符号短整数表示。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.projectTo2D",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:92268c40c2cc5df737a75bec382b8a41b72eeeedacd44959742ace3e58ca3859",
      "text": "将几何体的三维 <code>position</code> 属性投影为二维，将原 <code>position</code> 替换为独立的 <code>position3D</code> 和 <code>position2D</code> 属性。\n<p>\n没有 <code>position</code> 时，此函数不产生影响。\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.projectTo2D",
      "field": "exceptions/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:a2d59e4236dc92d440d08d2d561e6ab730d0cacbdbae637c4b181f479a6feaee",
      "text": "geometry 必须包含与 attributeName 参数匹配的属性。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.projectTo2D",
      "field": "exceptions/1/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:95f8bf10ed23d922b97b445a948c6585e3a1c53b7aef47e8f38afdd7ddcafbe6",
      "text": "属性的 componentDatatype 必须为 ComponentDatatype.DOUBLE。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.projectTo2D",
      "field": "exceptions/2/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:e75f1cc97b05e54f116be15febfa0893bfdb08dd76f275492661ac2d0619e3c5",
      "text": "无法将某个点投影到二维。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.projectTo2D",
      "field": "params/attributeName/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:dbcf97c4a4a016d98595663cd64cbfa15906e8a56a51550094231a010e44383f",
      "text": "属性名称。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.projectTo2D",
      "field": "params/attributeName2D/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:e2ef17061f124e1212dedf480828ed4fa9be6d4437b7bc19dc8bcf61e76e7395",
      "text": "二维属性的名称。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.projectTo2D",
      "field": "params/attributeName3D/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:ec0a64a853dcf14cbaf1e65519b0f40c108be0052a2ec748dd6bcfd4084d4aaa",
      "text": "三维属性的名称。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.projectTo2D",
      "field": "params/geometry/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:73e71711c64fae823007c59d74fde42b80de5ed6bb57fb49c56fdec15b0aa1ae",
      "text": "需要修改的几何体。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.projectTo2D",
      "field": "params/projection/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:067d7e5fdf5e9fce39ac0aada4f18c35331f47b8cb01133570b14a78a0650e10",
      "text": "使用的投影。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.projectTo2D",
      "field": "returns/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:2e7e2d858dd88229131dbfa0481f8c1247c9d96654db1707b2caae1a4178184a",
      "text": "修改后的 <code>geometry</code> 参数，包含 <code>position3D</code> 和 <code>position2D</code> 属性。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.reorderForPostVertexCache",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:5addc2b60c7efeeb4cfdab9f3a1fb44d8629689b5f0a953f4afcb476dd554a83",
      "text": "使用 Tipsify 算法重排几何体的 <code>indices</code>，以更有效地利用 GPU 顶点着色器后缓存。若 <code>primitiveType</code> 不是 <code>TRIANGLES</code>，或没有 <code>indices</code>，此函数不产生影响。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.reorderForPostVertexCache",
      "field": "exceptions/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:19188cdfac5a4df90643aeea5da168176a7086cd25d46e337304e11ef7998286",
      "text": "cacheCapacity 必须大于 2。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.reorderForPostVertexCache",
      "field": "params/cacheCapacity/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:242d4a5fce59c653545e78d93b16e0cd91e5e30281ddd302a96af583520e62ea",
      "text": "GPU 顶点缓存可容纳的顶点数量。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.reorderForPostVertexCache",
      "field": "params/geometry/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:73e71711c64fae823007c59d74fde42b80de5ed6bb57fb49c56fdec15b0aa1ae",
      "text": "需要修改的几何体。"
    },
