      "sourceHash": "sha256:0c20ff785f46b746b5505603ab2b336faa7513f32820121942c1cd72d8952386",
      "text": "修改后的 <code>geometry</code> 参数，其索引已为顶点着色器后缓存重新排序。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.reorderForPreVertexCache",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:e90791a9e62c4e4868ed49ffc96350238ee4bdc32cb1e685c00fd9047fb6faeb",
      "text": "重排几何体的属性和 <code>indices</code>，以更有效地利用 GPU 顶点着色器前缓存。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.reorderForPreVertexCache",
      "field": "exceptions/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:547e9a6dd2a704f341bffa33540a3be876ec7df2c248716ca4db3d10af9a1d9e",
      "text": "geometry.attributes 中各属性数组必须对应相同的顶点数量。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.reorderForPreVertexCache",
      "field": "params/geometry/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:73e71711c64fae823007c59d74fde42b80de5ed6bb57fb49c56fdec15b0aa1ae",
      "text": "需要修改的几何体。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.reorderForPreVertexCache",
      "field": "returns/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:bf82518dca343c93b00d7d2092c0b857326b519db0bfa145be154076d0f4a90c",
      "text": "修改后的 <code>geometry</code> 参数，其属性和索引已为 GPU 顶点着色器前缓存重新排序。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.toWireframe",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:ab0ca4e9cb6c814b0b57f06196bf997d361b2abaaba47dc3621cdcf53b3eb16c",
      "text": "将几何体的三角形索引转换为线段索引。存在 <code>indices</code> 且 <code>primitiveType</code> 为 <code>TRIANGLES</code>、<code>TRIANGLE_STRIP</code> 或 <code>TRIANGLE_FAN</code> 时，转换为 <code>LINES</code>；其他情况不改变几何体。\n<p>\n常用于创建线框几何，以便进行视觉调试。\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.toWireframe",
      "field": "exceptions/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:a6935f496fb36517d0bfce5db84fe33009d34aec57ae94ccad7c8f72744c9b56",
      "text": "geometry.primitiveType 必须为 TRIANGLES、TRIANGLE_STRIP 或 TRIANGLE_FAN。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.toWireframe",
      "field": "params/geometry/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:73e71711c64fae823007c59d74fde42b80de5ed6bb57fb49c56fdec15b0aa1ae",
      "text": "需要修改的几何体。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.toWireframe",
      "field": "returns/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:85254b14ee8a39dfa5eab86524a4ec55fad71a04b1b06dfa3ceda07bc682b60a",
      "text": "修改后的 <code>geometry</code> 参数，其三角形索引已转换为线段索引。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.transformToWorldCoordinates",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:b5eb80c856dc3c2d50fa682248b07de478f86e67710e5a1f1b43129692865001",
      "text": "将几何实例变换到世界坐标。会将实例的 <code>modelMatrix</code> 设为 {@link Matrix4.IDENTITY}，并变换以下已存在的属性：<code>position</code>、<code>normal</code>、<code>tangent</code> 和 <code>bitangent</code>。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.transformToWorldCoordinates",
      "field": "params/instance/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:2fdc61acf76a9f33c67187f94c2900943e23e0f6bdc3b089ef56df7e06ff00da",
      "text": "需要修改的几何实例。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline.transformToWorldCoordinates",
      "field": "returns/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:c249cde2804539959fa1db969966a58bcaa2a2fd2b5e91438978ab60fdcc91ef",
      "text": "修改后的 <code>instance</code> 参数，其属性已变换到世界坐标。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GeometryPipeline",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:28cfd1de0c9619aff4c204e56f9714caecca7ab73a3e183e8f388b6445560d64",
      "text": "几何内容处理管线函数。"
    }
  ]
